Step 2: Set up SQLite in backend/server.js
Here is a clean implementation in backend/server.js that:

Opens/creates database.db inside your backend/ directory.

Enables WAL (Write-Ahead Logging) mode for maximum performance and multi-reader concurrency.

Automatically creates the users table on startup if it doesn't already exist.

