The Closed Security Model
To enforce "Invitation-Only" access for non-standard users (developer, admin, superuser), we introduce an invitations table and a Whitelisted Email Policy.

1. Updated SQLite Schema
We add an invitations table to store valid sign-up tokens sent to pre-approved email addresses.

