Session Storage: Save the returned JWT token to localStorage or sessionStorage so the user stays logged in.

Step 1: Add the Login JavaScript (frontend/portal.js)
Create or update frontend/portal.js and link it inside your portal.html script tag (<script type="module" src="/portal.js"></script>):

JavaScript
￼
