Looking at your provided portal.html, the issue is clear: your inline JavaScript is pointing directly to http://localhost:5000/api/auth.

Because your Vite dev server (npm run dev) runs on port 5173 and proxies requests to port 5000, hardcoding http://localhost:5000 bypasses Vite, causing CORS errors or failed network requests in the browser.

In addition, the script was checking for data.success instead of validating standard HTTP responses (res.ok) and checking for data.requires2FA.

