# 🛠️ Superuser Dashboard Specification

The Superuser Dashboard provides full-spectrum administrative control, system observability, and user management across the entire application ecosystem.

```
                  ┌─────────────────────────┐
                  │   SUPERUSER DASHBOARD   │
                  └────────────┬────────────┘
